docs {
Upload gambar kata ke penyimpanan publik (GitHub → jsDelivr).
Multipart field `file`, query `purpose=word`. Role: admin, editor,
contributor, root, reviewer. Rate 30/menit.

ImageKit tetap dipakai laporan bug / bukti verifikator
(`GET /admin/images/upload-token`, `GET /bug-reports/upload-token`).

201 sukses:

    {
      "success": true,
      "data": {
        "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sambasku/images@main/assets/words/01J….jpg",
        "provider": "github",
        "provider_file_id": "assets/words/01J….jpg",
        "sha": "a1b2c3…"
      }
    }

503 kalau PUBLIC_IMAGE_GITHUB_* belum diisi:

    { "success": false, "error_code": "PUBLIC_IMAGE_UPLOAD_UNAVAILABLE", … }

Lalu kirim url + provider_file_id (+ sha opsional) ke POST kata /
POST words/:id/images.
}

meta {
  name: Upload Public Image (Word)
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/images?purpose=word
  body: multipartForm
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{access_token}}
}

body:multipart-form {
  file: @file(/tmp/sambasku-word-sample.jpg)
}

tests {
  test("201 github ATAU 503 belum dikonfigurasi", () => {
    expect([201, 503]).to.include(res.status);
    if (res.status === 201) {
      expect(res.body.data.url).to.contain('jsdelivr');
      expect(res.body.data.provider).to.equal('github');
      expect(res.body.data.provider_file_id).to.be.a('string');
      expect(res.body.data.sha).to.be.a('string');
    } else {
      expect(res.body.error_code).to.equal('PUBLIC_IMAGE_UPLOAD_UNAVAILABLE');
    }
  });
}
